OL,3,GNEWSAMatchday urinating raised in views
OL,4,Aover new Man Utd stadium
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents living near Manchester
OL,7,FUnited's stadium are calling for more
OL,8,Fto be done to tackle anti-social
OL,9,Fbehaviour on matchdays - including
OL,10,Furinating in alleyways - amid a
OL,11,Fconsultation on plans to build a new
OL,12,F100,000-capacity ground nearby.
OL,14,FFeedback from Old Trafford residents
OL,15,Fwas given to the newly set-up Old
OL,16,FTrafford Regeneration Mayoral
OL,17,FDevelopment Corporation (MDC) as part
OL,18,Fof the consultation.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,408,400,260,160,0,100
