OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMatchday urinating raised in views
OL,4,Aover new Man Utd stadium
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking at an MDC meeting, Trafford
OL,7,Fcouncillor Dave Acton said residents
OL,8,Fhad complained to him about some fans
OL,9,Furinating in alleyways, littering, and
OL,10,Fparking issues.
OL,12,FThe MDC said it would use the responses
OL,13,Fto finalise the regeneration
OL,14,Fmasterplan, due to go before the
OL,15,Fcouncil's cabinet early next year.
